  "title": "Meta Introduces Meta AI Chat to Threads DMs",
  "summary": "Meta has introduced a Meta AI chatbot within Threads' DMs, allowing users to interact with the AI assistant for conversations. This feature is available for messaging within the platform, following its availability in other social media platforms.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Meta announced the rollout of its Meta AI chatbot within Threads' DMs in a Monday update.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Meta AI chatbot is available to users in DMs on the platform, similar to how it's available on other social media platforms.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The rollout is part of Meta's broader strategy to enhance user interaction with AI tools.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
